<Base title="About" description="About Omar Mo">
	<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-content sm:text-5xl">About</h1>
	<div class="prose-site mt-8">
		<p>
			I am a self-taught full-stack engineer who likes building useful products, writing about software and work, and keeping a small personal corner of the web.
		</p>
		<p>
			This site collects my writing, projects, notes, and recipes. It is intentionally simple while I migrate away from the old template and rebuild the design properly.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>
